# UNDERDELVE: the opening, by buttons alone. The cartridge boots straight
# into Mo's camp. Walk east through the shrine hall (the dustmoths drift
# about) into the gem grotto, hop up two planks for its gem, walk back,
# strike the dustmoth that drifts down onto the walkway, climb down the
# ladder to the owl's exchange, strike the chest there open and spend the
# ore on the copper pot and the climbing gloves. Not a lantern lost.
game underdelve
wait 15
expect state == 1
expect room_x == 0
expect room_y == 5
hold RIGHT 620
expect room_x == 2
expect deaths == 0
hold RIGHT 75
hold A 3
wait 40
expect py == 98
hold RIGHT 15
hold A 3
wait 40
expect py == 66
hold RIGHT 55
expect money == 100
hold LEFT 200
expect room_x == 1
hold LEFT 46
wait 10
press B
wait 20
expect enemies == 1
expect deaths == 0
hold DOWN 240
expect room_x == 1
expect room_y == 6
hold RIGHT 30
press B
wait 20
expect money == 150
hold LEFT 125
press UP
wait 5
expect items & 1
expect money == 100
hold LEFT 32
press UP
wait 5
expect items & 8
expect money == 0
expect deaths == 0
expect lanterns == 6
